<view class="page"><view class="page-title serif">会员企业与产品</view><view wx:if="{{!id}}" class="enterprise-intro">在这里展示企业风采，面向全球推介优质产品，助力会员企业拓宽出海曝光渠道，对外传递品牌实力。</view><view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="card muted">正在读取…</view><view wx:elif="{{error}}" class="card">{{error}}<button bindtap="refresh">重新读取</button></view><view wx:elif="{{selected}}" class="card"><image wx:if="{{selected.logoSrc}}" class="logo" src="{{selected.logoSrc}}" mode="aspectFit"/><view class="section-title">{{selected.name}}</view><view class="subtitle">{{selected.summary}}</view><text class="body" selectable>{{selected.body}}</text></view><block wx:else><button wx:for="{{items}}" wx:key="id" class="card enterprise" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="open"><image wx:if="{{item.logoSrc}}" class="logo" src="{{item.logoSrc}}" mode="aspectFit"/><view class="section-title">{{item.name}}</view><view class="subtitle">{{item.summary}}</view><view>查看介绍 ›</view></button><view wx:if="{{!items.length}}" class="card muted enterprise-empty">会员企业介绍正在整理中，待更多产品完成入库，正式发布后相关内容将在此呈现。</view></block><button class="secondary-action" bindtap="openSupply">上传我的产品服务</button></view>